{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/c247b2fe265146f7994d52ba5ff6c548","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/c247b2fe265146f7994d52ba5ff6c548","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003eDe Brogen \u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/olajfp1l/first-blog-image.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eThe Job\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDer Brogen\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVenetia\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/u45hchys/blog-images2.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eThe Technology\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDer Brogen\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVenetia\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/5zqdyjr4/blog-images3.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eImpact and Timeline\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDer Brogen\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVenetia\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/mbumqmdy/blog-images4.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u0